! Projectify

Projectify is a project management app for [[TiddlyWiki|https://tiddlywiki.com]], inspired by products like [[Todoist|https://todoist.com]] and [[Basecamp|https://basecamp.com]].

This is a maintained fork by [[Matt Blackman|https://github.com/mblackman]] published as `$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify`, forked from the original project by [[Nicolas Petton|https://nicolas.petton.fr]].

[[TiddlyWiki|https://tiddlywiki.com]] is an excellent note-taking & knowledge-base app with [[unique features|https://tiddlywiki.com/#TiddlyWiki]]. Projectify brings project management to ~TiddlyWiki, extending it to let you [[capture thoughts|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Inbox]], [[plan projects|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Projects]] and [[schedule tasks|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/doc/Schedule]].

Projectify is carefully crafted, with an intuitive interface that integrates seamlessly with the core of ~TiddlyWiki. [[Drag and drop|https://tiddlywiki.com/#Drag%20and%20Drop]] any tiddler into a project to add it as a todo, [[transclude|https://tiddlywiki.com/#Transclusion]] and [[link|https://tiddlywiki.com/#Linking%20in%20WikiText]] other tiddlers into projects or tasks.

For all changes in the latest {{$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify!!version}} release, see [[ChangeLog|$:/plugins/mblackman/projectify/changelog]].

!! Demo

A demo is available at [[mblackman.github.io/Projectify|https://mblackman.github.io/Projectify]].

